  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "こ、これ……\r\nわたしの載ってる、パンフレット……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、事務所にも届いてたんだけど\r\n実際にこうやって貰いに来るのも、いいかと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わ……！\r\nちょ、ちょっと中見てもいいですか……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、小糸のコメントも載ってるし\r\n……あの子のも、載ってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
