  {
    "id": 2022005110200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "やっぱり\r\n……すごいなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸が知りたがってたこと、知れたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nプロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──よし、\r\nじゃあお参り行くか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、そ、そうでした\r\nお参りしないと……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸は何をお願いするんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え、えっと……\r\nみ、みんなの健康は前にもお願いしたので",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "べ、別のがいいんですかね……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "せっかく来たんだし、\r\n別のことをお願いしてもいいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110260,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………じゃ、じゃあ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110270,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "世界中のみんなに元気を\r\nあげられるアイドルになれますように……とか……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110280,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "で、ですかね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか\r\nそうだなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005110290,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……あ……や、やっぱり\r\n大きいこと言い過ぎましたかね……",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200511/2022005110290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいや\r\nすごく大きな目標ではあるけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "神様に願う必要は、無いかもな",
